making this barn appear to be bending upwards.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:28.080
The new AI is can fix that too. Not a problem&nbsp;
at all. It is absolutely incredible that humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:34.500
are able to build AI-based algorithms that are&nbsp;
this capable today. What a time to be alive!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:39.780
Now, not even this technique is&nbsp;
